[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イェイ！\u3000勝ったわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! We won!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねぇ。私、こんな風にやってたんでしょ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey. This is how I used to fight, isn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア、思い出したの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria, did you remember something!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん、思い出したっていうか、\n身体が覚えてたって感じかしら……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, it's not so much remembering... more like my body moved on its own..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、ちょっとすっきりした気分",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Still, I feel a bit lighter somehow."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか……うん、うん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... Yeah, yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんね。全部思い出せばいいんだけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry. I wish I could remember everything..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "焦らなくていいんだよ、ヴァレリア。\n前から言ってる通り、ゆっくり思い出していこう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's no need to rush, Valeria. Like I've been saying, let's take it slow, okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう、レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you, Resna"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん。私を助けてくれてありがとう。\nかっこよかったよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, thank you for helping me. You were amazing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナだって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You were too..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "師匠相手に啖呵を切ったところ、かっこよかったわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The way you stood up to your mentor—that was pretty cool!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そうかな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-you think so...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねぇ。レスナの夢、私に詳しく聞かせてくれない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey. Would you tell me more about your dream?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私の夢？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My dream?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "聞きたいの。……ううん、聞かなきゃダメだって思う",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want to know... No, I feel like I need to know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……うん！\u3000何度だって話すよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... Of course! I'll tell you as many times as you want!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私の夢はね――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My dream is—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]